e:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;text-align:justify;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"/><td style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">(1)</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><i style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">Calculated based upon the closing market price of our common stock as of December</i><i style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</i><i style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">31, 2025, the last trading day of our 2025 fiscal</i><i style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</i><i style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">year ($1.13) multiplied by the number of unvested awards at</i><i style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</i><i style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">year-end. As of December</i><i style="font-family:'Arial','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">&#160;</i><i style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:normal;">31, 2025, vesting of the RSUs as a result of a Change of Control Event or Transactions (as defined in the applicable award agreements) had not occurred, and the RSUs remained unvested.</i></td></tr></table><a id="_2ebbca18_f5e5_4c40_9759_daae36c69d51"></a><a id="DIRECTORCOMPENSATION"></a><p style="font-family:'Calibri','Helvetica','sans-serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:center;margin:12pt 0pt 6pt 0pt;"><b st